手动安装:
    1. 下载SDK
    https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/stable/linux/flutter_linux_3.44.1-stable.tar.xz

    2. 解压
    tar -xf flutter_linux_3.44.1-stable.tar.xz -C flutter_linux_3.44.1-stable

    3. SDK 添加到PATH环境变量
    echo 'export PATH="flutter_linux_3.44.1-stable/bin:$PATH"' >> ~/.bashrc

创建项目:
    flutter create helloflutter


升级flutter:
    flutter upgrade

















